From 51ee45c87a3c8a054710407ff461ed21f28fd8d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alle4you <56454046+Alle4you@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:20:14 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] qualcommax: ipq50xx: add support for Xiaomi AX3000 (RA80)

Hardware:
- SoC: Qualcomm IPQ5000 (IPQ5018 family), 2x Cortex-A53
- RAM: 256 MiB
- Flash: 128 MiB NAND (GigaDevice), 2 KiB pages, 128 KiB blocks
- 2.4 GHz: IPQ5018 integrated, 2x2 802.11ax
- 5 GHz: QCN6102 (QCN6122 family, ahb), 2x2 802.11ax
- Ethernet: IPQ5018 GE PHY + QCA8337 switch, 1x WAN + 3x LAN gigabit
- Buttons: reset (GPIO25), mesh (GPIO23)
- Serial: J1, 1.8 V, 115200 8N1 (1: VCC, 2: RX, 3: GND, 4: TX)

Notes:
- The NAND needs 8-bit ECC. With the 4-bit default every read of the
  ART and UBI returns -EBADMSG and the image would be unreadable by the
  stock U-Boot.
- The board files come from the stock firmware (WLAN.HK.2.5.r4). With the
  OpenWrt firmware (WLAN.HK.2.7.0.1) both radios assert in
  phyrf_bdf.c:605 unless byte 0x45c is cleared (checksum fixed).
- Caldata is only extracted from ART (0x1000 and 0x26800); the radio MACs
  are already inside it.
- Both radios use FW memory mode 2.
- OpenWrt always goes to the first slot (rootfs, mtd18); the stock image
  can stay in rootfs_1. The bootcount script confirms the boot in the
  Xiaomi U-Boot environment.

Signed-off-by: Alle4you <56454046+Alle4you@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx   |   1 +
 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/Makefile            |   2 +
 .../files/board-xiaomi_ax3000.ipq5018         | Bin 0 -> 131176 bytes
 .../files/board-xiaomi_ax3000.qcn6122         | Bin 0 -> 131176 bytes
 .../arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq5018-ax3000.dts    | 393 ++++++++++++++++++
 target/linux/qualcommax/image/ipq50xx.mk      |  16 +
 .../ipq50xx/base-files/etc/board.d/02_network |   1 +
 .../etc/hotplug.d/firmware/11-ath11k-caldata  |   4 +
 .../ipq50xx/base-files/etc/init.d/bootcount   |  43 ++
 .../base-files/lib/upgrade/platform.sh        |  16 +
 10 files changed, 476 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/files/board-xiaomi_ax3000.ipq5018
 create mode 100644 package/firmware/ipq-wifi/files/board-xiaomi_ax3000.qcn6122
 create mode 100644 target/linux/qualcommax/files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq5018-ax3000.dts

diff --git a/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx b/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx
index 6366859fc3..2a4ceafe17 100644
--- a/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx
+++ b/package/boot/uboot-tools/uboot-envtools/files/qualcommax_ipq50xx
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@ linksys,mx6200|\
 linksys,spnmx56)
 	ubootenv_add_mtd "u_env" "0x0" "0x40000" "0x20000"
 	;;
+xiaomi,ax3000|\
 xiaomi,ax6000)
 	ubootenv_add_mtd "0:appsblenv" "0x0" "0x10000" "0x20000"
 	ubootenv_add_sys_mtd "bdata" "0x0" "0x10000" "0x20000"
